title: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request
route: /dashboard?request=P-1499
intro: The drawer is one scroll, with no tabs. It opens from a row, a case ID, a Do next button, or a link with ?request=ID, and shows who holds the request, its history and what is next. The sections change with the request's stage. The long lines are folded under 'Details'.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click a row or a case ID in the table, or a Do next button such as 'Review answer'"
start s2 "Follow a link with ?request=ID\nA notification, 'See on the Dashboard', 'Open R-xxxx' on another page"
process p1 "Address gets ?request=ID\nThe page is dimmed behind the drawer"
overlay o1 "Request drawer slides in from the right\nHeader, body, footer"

group gHead "Header"
  screen h1 "Title 'P-1499 · Harborview MA'\nSubtitle 'PHP continued stay · sent Sun 4:36 pm' or '... · not sent yet'"
  screen h2 "Stage chip on the right\ne.g. 'Info requested'"
endgroup

group gBody "Body, from the top down"
  screen b1 "Action box (only some requests)\n'Needs your input', 'Packet is drafting the answer' or 'Approved. Write-back waits for you'\nThe last one shows only while write-back is on in EMR Connect; otherwise a calm line says it is off"
  screen b2 "Facts\nPatient 'E.S., 42', Held by (agent and next step)\nFor a Medicaid managed care request on day 5 of the CMS clock or later: 'Decision time: Day 5 of 7 under the CMS rule for Medicaid managed care' (or 'Past 7 days')"
  decision d1 "Does the request have a chance figure?"
  screen b3 "'Approval chance' or, for a denial, 'Chance of winning'\n'74% · Moderate · likely 66 to 82% · 219 similar cases'"
  screen b5 "History\nEvery event, oldest first, or 'No events yet.'\nGreen dot with the time; dashed dot with 'Scheduled · time'"
  screen b6 "Details, closed\nOne line: 'Sent through the payer's portal · next check in 30 minutes'\nOpen it for 'Sent' ('Not sent yet', 'Signed and sent through the payer's portal', 'by fax' or 'by phone') and 'Checks' (the message below)"
  overlay b7 "Demo controls\nDashed box: pretend the payer answered\nOnly the replies still ahead of the request show"
endgroup

decision d2 "Which message does Checks show?"
toast m1 "Received or Under review\n'Next automatic check in 30 minutes.'"
toast m2 "Preparing\n'Not sent yet. Automatic checks start once the request is signed and sent.'"
toast m3 "Info requested\n'Waiting on you, not on the payer. Automatic checks resume once the answer is sent.'"
toast m4 "Decided\n'Decided. Cadence booked the next review, so no more checks are needed.'"
toast m5 "Appeal or call, next step starts with 'Waiting'\n'Navigator checks again every 2 hours until the decision date.'"
toast m6 "Appeal or call, any other\n'Advocate has the next step. Open Denial Intelligence for the brief.'"

goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Needs you and write-back boxes"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Demo controls: the payer answers"
goto g3 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Check now, Open case and closing"

s1 --> p1
s2 --> p1
p1 --> o1 --> h1 --> h2
h2 --> b1 --> b2 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| b3 --> b5
d1 -->|No| b5
b5 --> b6 --> d2
d2 -->|Received, Under review| m1
d2 -->|Preparing| m2
d2 -->|Info requested| m3
d2 -->|Decided| m4
d2 -->|Appeal or call, next starts with Waiting| m5
d2 -->|Appeal or call, anything else| m6
b6 --> b7
b1 -.-> g1
b7 --> g2
h2 -.-> g3
